From: Hardened NanoKVM security maintenance
Subject: [PATCH] package/libcurl: update to 8.23.0

curl 8.22.0 and 8.23.0 (2026-10-14) fix the 21 advisories that affect 8.21.0,
among them CVE-2026-92392 (HTTP/2 upload use-after-free). The tarball's PGP
signature verifies with the published release key
27EDEAF22F3ABCEB50DB9A125CC908FDB71E12C2; the hash equals the upstream
Buildroot master pin and Fedora's sources file.

diff --git a/package/libcurl/libcurl.hash b/package/libcurl/libcurl.hash
--- a/package/libcurl/libcurl.hash
+++ b/package/libcurl/libcurl.hash
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
-# From https://github.com/curl/curl/releases/tag/curl-8_21_0
+# From https://github.com/curl/curl/releases/tag/curl-8_23_0
 # after checking pgp signature:
-# https://curl.se/download/curl-8.21.0.tar.xz.asc
+# https://curl.se/download/curl-8.23.0.tar.xz.asc
 # signed with key 27EDEAF22F3ABCEB50DB9A125CC908FDB71E12C2
-sha256  aa1b66a70eace83dc624508745646c08ae561de512ab403adffb93ac87fc72e6  curl-8.21.0.tar.xz
+sha256  8dadd7d2536a314f982ad05a651b713f426bf7d02cc2c76cffb9796f2218e6c5  curl-8.23.0.tar.xz
 # Locally computed
 sha256  82f2f4427d6545ee5aaac4f0b80428da6cc8ba41c2cf5da3a03680ec327b9681  COPYING
diff --git a/package/libcurl/libcurl.mk b/package/libcurl/libcurl.mk
--- a/package/libcurl/libcurl.mk
+++ b/package/libcurl/libcurl.mk
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #
 ################################################################################
 
-LIBCURL_VERSION = 8.21.0
+LIBCURL_VERSION = 8.23.0
 LIBCURL_SOURCE = curl-$(LIBCURL_VERSION).tar.xz
 LIBCURL_SITE = https://curl.se/download
 LIBCURL_DEPENDENCIES = host-pkgconf \
